Place a permitted OHLCV market-data CSV here, e.g. `sp500_ohlcv.csv`, with
Date, Open, High, Low, Close and optional Volume columns. This public release
contains no third-party market-data copies. The notebook may download market
data with yfinance by explicit opt-in; check Yahoo's terms and data quality.

The original coursework FRED CSVs, if separately shared, carry observation
period dates, not their real first-publication dates. Do NOT feed them into
a historical forecasting model without a point-in-time availability protocol.
